### Get all carsPopulated

GET http://localhost:5000/api/carsPopulated
Content-Type: application/json


### Get all carsPopulated with pagination and filters (brand and color only per task requirements)

GET http://localhost:5000/api/carsPopulated?limit=36&page=1&brand=BMW&color=серый
Content-Type: application/json


### Get all carsAggregated

GET http://localhost:5000/api/carsAggregated
Content-Type: application/json


### Get all carsAggregated with pagination and filters (brand and color only per task requirements)

GET http://localhost:5000/api/carsAggregated?limit=36&page=1&brand=BMW&color=серый
Content-Type: application/json


### Get car by Id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/cars/6ae900d8bf70aaa9742db540
Content-Type: application/json


### Create car

POST http://localhost:5000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Kamaz",
  "model": "54902A",
  "year": 2014,
  "color": "белый",
  "engine_type": "Дизельный",
  "bodywork_type": "Седельный тягач",
  "gear_type": "Автоматическая",
  "new": false,
  "typeId": "65f000000000000000000001"
}


### Update car

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "_id": "6aee97d30effc56e3c228ff6",
  "brand": "Kamaz",
  "model": "54902A",
  "year": 2000,
  "color": "белый",
  "engine_type": "Дизельный",
  "bodywork_type": "Седельный тягачЧЧЧ",
  "gear_type": "Автоматическая",
  "new": false,
  "typeId": "65f000000000000000000001"
}


### Delete car with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/cars/6ae900d8bf70aaa9742db547
Content-Type: application/json


### set logo for car 6ae900d8bf70aaa9742db540

POST http://localhost:5000/api/carlogo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="_id"

6ae900d8bf70aaa9742db540
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="bmw.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./cars/img/bmw.png
--WebAppBoundary--